CM_ "DRAFT can2gauge DBC: Haltech Elite / Nexus ECU Broadcast CAN Protocol (doc v2.0, 08/2025; Elite fw 3.11+, Nexus 1.25+). Fixed IDs, 1 Mbit, big-endian. Earlier firmware sends a subset; the 2012 Platinum 'V2' layout differs in 0x361, 0x370, 0x372 and 0x3E4.";
CM_ BO_ 864 "Source: Haltech ECU Broadcast CAN Protocol doc v2.0 (08/2025).";
CM_ SG_ 864 ManifoldPressure "Absolute kPa (gauge 'map' is mbar: x10).";
CM_ BO_ 865 "Source: Haltech ECU Broadcast CAN Protocol doc v2.0 (08/2025). 2012 V2.0 doc had accelerator pedal in bytes 4-5; current doc says Engine Demand.";
CM_ SG_ 865 FuelPressure "Gauge kPa = raw/10 - 101.3 (gauge 'fuelPressure' is bar: /100).";
CM_ SG_ 865 OilPressure "Gauge kPa = raw/10 - 101.3 (gauge 'oilPressure' is bar: /100).";
CM_ BO_ 866 "Source: Haltech ECU Broadcast CAN Protocol doc v2.0 (08/2025).";
CM_ BO_ 867 "Source: Haltech ECU Broadcast CAN Protocol doc v2.0 (08/2025).";
CM_ BO_ 868 "Source: Haltech ECU Broadcast CAN Protocol doc v2.0 (08/2025).";
CM_ BO_ 872 "Source: Haltech ECU Broadcast CAN Protocol doc v2.0 (08/2025).";
CM_ BO_ 873 "Source: Haltech ECU Broadcast CAN Protocol doc v2.0 (08/2025).";
CM_ BO_ 874 "Source: Haltech ECU Broadcast CAN Protocol doc v2.0 (08/2025).";
CM_ BO_ 875 "Source: Haltech ECU Broadcast CAN Protocol doc v2.0 (08/2025).";
