CM_ BO_ 877 "Source: Haltech ECU Broadcast CAN Protocol doc v2.0 (08/2025).";
CM_ BO_ 878 "Source: Haltech ECU Broadcast CAN Protocol doc v2.0 (08/2025).";
CM_ BO_ 879 "Source: Haltech ECU Broadcast CAN Protocol doc v2.0 (08/2025).";
CM_ BO_ 880 "Source: Haltech ECU Broadcast CAN Protocol doc v2.0 (08/2025). 2012 V2.0 doc: bytes 2-3 = Gear (0 neutral, 1 first).";
CM_ SG_ 880 CombinedSelector "Combined Gear (bytes 2-3, signed): selector = high byte. Splitting into two signed bytes assumes the same enum as 0x470 - UNVERIFIED.";
CM_ SG_ 880 CombinedGear "Combined Gear low byte = gear.";
CM_ BO_ 881 "Source: Haltech ECU Broadcast CAN Protocol doc v2.0 (08/2025).";
CM_ BO_ 882 "Source: Haltech ECU Broadcast CAN Protocol doc v2.0 (08/2025). 2012 V2.0 doc: bytes 2-3 = Air Temp Sensor 2.";
CM_ SG_ 882 BaroPressure "Absolute. Fingerprint: raw ~950-1050 big-endian.";
CM_ BO_ 883 "Source: Haltech ECU Broadcast CAN Protocol doc v2.0 (08/2025).";
CM_ BO_ 884 "Source: Haltech ECU Broadcast CAN Protocol doc v2.0 (08/2025).";
