CM_ BO_ 896 "Source: Haltech ECU Broadcast CAN Protocol doc v2.0 (08/2025).";
CM_ BO_ 992 "Source: Haltech ECU Broadcast CAN Protocol doc v2.0 (08/2025). Temperatures are Kelvin x10; converted to C here (offset -273.15).";
CM_ SG_ 992 CoolantTemp "Fingerprint: raw ~2731-3731 (0-100 C).";
CM_ BO_ 993 "Source: Haltech ECU Broadcast CAN Protocol doc v2.0 (08/2025).";
CM_ BO_ 994 "Source: Haltech ECU Broadcast CAN Protocol doc v2.0 (08/2025).";
CM_ SG_ 994 FuelLevel_B6 "Doc lists 'Fuel Level' twice (bytes 0-1 and 6-7) - UNVERIFIED what bytes 6-7 really are.";
CM_ BO_ 995 "Source: Haltech ECU Broadcast CAN Protocol doc v2.0 (08/2025).";
CM_ BO_ 996 "Source: Haltech ECU Broadcast CAN Protocol doc v2.0 (08/2025). Bit map differs completely from the 2012 V2.0 doc.";
