CM_ BO_ 998 "Source: Haltech ECU Broadcast CAN Protocol doc v2.0 (08/2025).";
CM_ BO_ 999 "Source: Haltech ECU Broadcast CAN Protocol doc v2.0 (08/2025). Generic sensors: scaling depends on the sensor type set in NSP (see doc 'Generic Sensors').";
CM_ BO_ 1000 "Source: Haltech ECU Broadcast CAN Protocol doc v2.0 (08/2025). Same ID as a Link Generic Dash on its usual ID 1000.";
